    "description": "<p>When you reach a Sorcerer level specified in the Draconic Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><table><caption>Draconic Spells</caption><thead><tr><td>Sorcerer Level</td><td>Spells</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td><em>Alter Self, Chromatic Orb, Command, Dragon's Breath</em></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><em>Fear, Fly</em></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><em>Arcane Eye, Charm Monster</em></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td><em>Legend Lore, Summon Dragon</em></td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-kL8H0ClyrUNajoht\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The spells will be automatically granted as you level up.</p></section>",
